	speech_tutorial1_k2_T1LA1_Tutor_name = "T1LA1_Tutor"
	speech_tutorial1_k2_Subtitle_Text_35 = "At any time during the tutorial, you may hit F4 to view your message history."
	speech_tutorial2_k2_T2LA1_Tutor_name = "T2LA1_Tutor"
	speech_tutorial2_k2_Subtitle_Text_40 = "When a company is selected, you can change its formation by selecting any of the three formation buttons available on the interface.  Changing formation will affect your company's speed and attack efficiency.  While in combat formation, your company will attack at its maximum efficiency, but will move very slowly.  In comparison, your companies will move very quickly in the column formation, but will have low attack efficiency."
	speech_tutorial2_k2_T2LA2_Tutor_name = "T2LA2_Tutor"
	speech_tutorial2_k2_Subtitle_Text_41 = "Clicking on a hero portrait will select that hero's company.  Clicking again will move the screen to focus on that hero."
	speech_tutorial2_k2_Subtitle_Text_42 = "You can attach a hero to any company in supply by selecting that company, clicking the Attach button, and then selecting the desired hero in the hero menu.  The selected hero will become the new leader of that company.  Heroes can be detached as well, using the Detach button."
	speech_tutorial2_k2_Subtitle_Text_43 = "Now that you know how to start a fight and retreat from one, your first task of conquest sits before you.  This is a tech lair.  Once tech lairs are captured, and as long as they remain under your control, they provide a technology to your kingdom.  Go ahead and capture this tech lair by attacking with your companies."
	speech_tutorial2_k2_Subtitle_Text_44 = "Good work, the lair is now yours.  You can click on the technology panel button to see a list of the technologies you have gained in this manner."
	speech_tutorial2_k2_Subtitle_Text_45 = "Some technologies can only be researched within your settlements.  Please select the Foundry structure inside your settlement."
	speech_tutorial2_k2_Subtitle_Text_46 = "The Foundry is an upgraded Blacksmith and there are no further upgrade options available to it.  Instead, there is now a Research button.  Click on this button to access the available technologies."
	speech_tutorial2_k2_Subtitle_Text_47 = "You can now tooltip the technology buttons to see what benefits each will provide once they're researched.  To begin researching, left-click on one of the available technology buttons."
	speech_tutorial2_k2_Subtitle_Text_48 = "Once a technology is done researching, it will be applied to your entire kingdom."
	speech_tutorial2_k2_T2LA3_Tutor_name = "T2LA3_Tutor"
	speech_tutorial2_k2_Subtitle_Text_49 = "Now click on the Custom Company button.  This will bring up the custom company editor."
